                    "copy": "PC version published by 505 Games. ©2019 Sony Interactive Entertainment Inc. DEATH STRANDING is a trademark of Sony Interactive Entertainment LLC. Created and developed by KOJIMA PRODUCTIONS. All trademarks are the property of their respective owners.  505 Games and the 505 Games logo are registered trademarks of 505 Games S.P.A. Appearance in this game does not imply sponsorship or endorsement. © 2020 Valve Corporation. All rights reserved. Valve, the Valve logo, Half-Life, the Half-Life logo, Portal, the Portal logo, and the Lambda logo are trademarks and/or registered trademarks of Valve Corporation in the U.S. and/or other countries",
                    "privacyPolicyLink": {
